{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-3","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……？\r\nこの声は……","trans":"……？\n这个声音是……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-9","name":"プロデューサー","text":"綺麗な声が聞こえたからさ\r\nつい、誘われて来ちゃったよ","trans":"因为听见了很好听的声音\n就不知不觉被吸引过来了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-13","name":"プロデューサー","text":"うん？","trans":"嗯？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008021110050","name":"霧子","text":"もう１回……\r\nいいですか……？","trans":"再来一次……\n可以吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008021110060","name":"霧子","text":"……\r\n歌っても……","trans":"……\n我唱……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-18","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ああ、ぜひ聴かせてくれ","trans":"嗯，一定让我听听","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008021110070","name":"霧子","text":"はい……\r\n聴いてください……","trans":"好……\n请听……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008021110090","name":"霧子","text":"どう……\r\nでしたか……？","trans":"唱得……\n怎么样呢……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-27","name":"プロデューサー","text":"とても優しくて\r\nそれでいてよく響く、素敵な歌だったよ","trans":"非常温柔\n又很通透，是首很棒的歌","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-28","name":"プロデューサー","text":"それに、あたたかみもたくさん感じた","trans":"而且，也让人感觉到很多暖意","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008021110110","name":"霧子","text":"今の……\r\n歌は……","trans":"刚才的……\n歌……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008021110120","name":"霧子","text":"プロデューサーさんに……\r\nって……思いながら……","trans":"是想着……\n要唱给制作人的……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-33","name":"プロデューサー","text":"そ、そうだったのか……\r\nはは……","trans":"是、是这样啊……\n哈哈……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-35","name":"プロデューサー","text":"いや、なんでもないよ\r\nそれより、ありがとうな","trans":"不，没什么\n比起这个，谢谢你","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008021110140","name":"霧子","text":"はい……","trans":"好的……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008021110150","name":"霧子","text":"プロデューサーさんに……\r\n歌う……歌は……","trans":"唱给制作人的……\n歌……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008021110160","name":"霧子","text":"きっと……\r\nもっと……","trans":"一定……\n还会更……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008021110170","name":"霧子","text":"もっと……\r\n深く……","trans":"更加……\n深深地……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008021110180","name":"霧子","text":"１歩……","trans":"1步……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008021110190","name":"霧子","text":"もう１歩……\r\nって……","trans":"再往前一步……\n这样……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008021110200","name":"霧子","text":"進み続けて……","trans":"一直走下去……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008021110210","name":"霧子","text":"識って……\r\nいくから……","trans":"会继续……\n认识下去……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008021110230","name":"霧子","text":"しばらくしたら……\r\nまた……","trans":"过一阵子……\n再……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008021110240","name":"霧子","text":"聴いて……\r\nくれますか……？","trans":"愿意……\n听我唱吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-54","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ああ、聴かせてほしい","trans":"嗯，我想听","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-55","name":"プロデューサー","text":"何度でも","trans":"多少次都行","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008021110260","name":"霧子","text":"識るたびに……","trans":"每次认识……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008021110270","name":"霧子","text":"新しく……\r\n生まれるから……","trans":"都会有新的……\n东西诞生……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008021110280","name":"霧子","text":"きらきら……","trans":"闪闪发亮……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008021110290"